  "limits": [
    "Ordinary miner listener actions only. Fear is mapped to the shared logical Fear status. Each root uses a sampled native interval; the blood child waits its own full one-second interval after admission. Root and non-derived child ownership are distinct. Guardian FinishBuff is terminal for that root; existing tile suppression expires independently. Native initial attachment, compiled frame order and local 16-9 talent selection remain unproven. No local or stage admission."
